{"4380240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ye Old Seadog", "steam_appid": 4380240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Evenkeel Harbor!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/4f1831f7cfb421c5ca50b25209a52685.poster.avif?t=1788287033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/4f1831f7cfb421c5ca50b25209a52685.webm?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/4f1831f7cfb421c5ca50b25209a52685.mp4?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ye Old Seadog puts you behind the bar at the most chaotic establishment on the known seas. As the newly appointed tavern keeper in Evenkeel Harbor, your goal is simple: keep the ale flowing out and the Crowns flowing in. But in a port full of thirsty pirates, nothing goes according to plan. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/eedbbaa90f1b78103cb6974758f206a4.poster.avif?t=1788287033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/eedbbaa90f1b78103cb6974758f206a4.webm?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/eedbbaa90f1b78103cb6974758f206a4.mp4?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a difficult task, trying to appease to a difficult customer base. Running a pirate tavern is a test of speed and strategy. You must manage your resources, pour drinks with precision, and keep your customers happy before their patience runs out. A happy pirate tips well; an angry one might just leave you high and dry. A drunk pirate is a happy pirate, mostly. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage The Tavern</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/cb4273ca7fd0eaf7d68092e7f4a667c6.poster.avif?t=1788287033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/cb4273ca7fd0eaf7d68092e7f4a667c6.webm?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/cb4273ca7fd0eaf7d68092e7f4a667c6.mp4?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a close eye on your inventory. You aren't just a bartender; you are the manager. Ensuring your kegs are full and your tables are clean is the only way to survive the rush. Every day brings a new wave of customers with different demands. Learn to be flexible, like a pirate flag in the wind. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Legend</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/a6e570cf64d46874ba0f6ff5f3d6f7e0.poster.avif?t=1788287033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/a6e570cf64d46874ba0f6ff5f3d6f7e0.webm?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/a6e570cf64d46874ba0f6ff5f3d6f7e0.mp4?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your tavern become the crown jewel of Evenkeel Harbor, or will you walk the plank? The fate of <span class=\"bb_strike\">the seas</span>  your tavern is in your hands.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Evenkeel Harbor!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/4f1831f7cfb421c5ca50b25209a52685.poster.avif?t=1788287033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/4f1831f7cfb421c5ca50b25209a52685.webm?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/4f1831f7cfb421c5ca50b25209a52685.mp4?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ye Old Seadog puts you behind the bar at the most chaotic establishment on the known seas. As the newly appointed tavern keeper in Evenkeel Harbor, your goal is simple: keep the ale flowing out and the Crowns flowing in. But in a port full of thirsty pirates, nothing goes according to plan. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/eedbbaa90f1b78103cb6974758f206a4.poster.avif?t=1788287033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/eedbbaa90f1b78103cb6974758f206a4.webm?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/eedbbaa90f1b78103cb6974758f206a4.mp4?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a difficult task, trying to appease to a difficult customer base. Running a pirate tavern is a test of speed and strategy. You must manage your resources, pour drinks with precision, and keep your customers happy before their patience runs out. A happy pirate tips well; an angry one might just leave you high and dry. A drunk pirate is a happy pirate, mostly. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage The Tavern</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/cb4273ca7fd0eaf7d68092e7f4a667c6.poster.avif?t=1788287033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/cb4273ca7fd0eaf7d68092e7f4a667c6.webm?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/cb4273ca7fd0eaf7d68092e7f4a667c6.mp4?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a close eye on your inventory. You aren't just a bartender; you are the manager. Ensuring your kegs are full and your tables are clean is the only way to survive the rush. Every day brings a new wave of customers with different demands. Learn to be flexible, like a pirate flag in the wind. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Legend</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/a6e570cf64d46874ba0f6ff5f3d6f7e0.poster.avif?t=1788287033\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/a6e570cf64d46874ba0f6ff5f3d6f7e0.webm?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/extras/a6e570cf64d46874ba0f6ff5f3d6f7e0.mp4?t=1788287033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your tavern become the crown jewel of Evenkeel Harbor, or will you walk the plank? The fate of <span class=\"bb_strike\">the seas</span>  your tavern is in your hands.</p>", "short_description": "Ye Old Seadog is a frantic tavern manager where you run a bar for thirsty pirates. Manage resources, serve drinks, and survive the chaos of a busy night. Will you become the legendary tavern of the Evenkeel Harbor, or walk the plank? Arrrgh!", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/e494d5eb3b3d288ef82d6124629d45cf2b4ad000/header.jpg?t=1788287033", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/2bb7ffa11d34877ee3b8162b325a65a8765d9e96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788287033", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380240/2bb7ffa11d34877ee3b8162b325a65a8765d9e96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788287033", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Studio Misfits"], "publishers": ["Studio Misfits"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "desc